    "explain": "n. a) Year in relation to life; age; old age. -- ax-a. Older (of persons). degyy. Younger (of persons). -- jeke. Aged, long-lived. --n du daruydaxu. To be weighed down by the years, carry the burden of old age. bay-a --. Childhood, young age. bay-a zalayu --. Young, vigorous age. nilcayai bay-a --. Infancy, childhood. ter-e nada ece nige -- ax-a. He is one year older than I. xar-a bay-a --n dayan. In one's childhood. b) Lifetime, rebirth, reincarnation. -- baraxu. To die. --n ece anggiziraxu. To depart from life; to die. --n tegylder. Possessing life, alive, living; venerable. --n u ecys tyr kyrky. To approach the end of one's life; to age. --n u todxar. Lifetime burden or hindrance. ønggereky. To pass away, die. bi nigen -- ber umartaxu ygei. I shall not forget it all my life . urida -- . Previous incarnation. urtu --. Long life, longevity. xoitu --. Future rebirth or life. c) Specifically mature age, maturity; the time of life at which some particular power or capacity develops. bolxu. To age, become old, become of a (certain) age. -- gyicegsen. Full-grown -- jabuxu. To grow old. -- kyrygsen. Adult, grownup. --n du kyrygedyi kymys. Minors, those who have not reached maturity. --n u ider. Vigorous years of life, prime of life. øsky --. Adolescence.",
