    "explain": "[ cf. orun ] n. Place; bed; vacant place, vacan- cy; trace; (factual) basis. debisker. Bedding. der-e. Bedding. ji nøkyky. To fill a vacancy; to replace. orun du talbixu. To allocate, put each in its place. suray. Information; trace. suray ygei. Without a trace (e.g. disappear ing without a trace). ygei. Without a basis, trace; groundless, unfounded. ygei [ber] usadxaxu. To destroy without leaving a trace. ygei cuurxal ud. Unfounded, wild rumor, nonsensical news, unfounded gossip. zasaxu. To make the bed. ebedciten i kebtegylyn sobilaxu--.Bed for patients. tere jabuysan ece xoisi -- suray ygei bolba. Since he left nothing has been heard of him.",
