    "tradRom": "oru-",
    "imageName": "LessingDict_Page_0620.jpg",
    "explain": "v.1. a) To enter, go or come into a place, space, substance, state or condition; to penetrate; to be received (as proceeds, income). --xui yarxui. Receipts and expenses. --xui anu yarxui dur yly kyrylceky. The income does not cover the expenses. ami --xu. To become alive, revive. erke cilygety baidal dur --xu. To become free (lit. to enter into state of liberty). ger tyr --xu. To enter a house. kycy --xu. To gather or recover strength; to need strength. nykelen --xu. To undermine (e.g. a city wall). tamir tengkege --xu. To recover strength, feel stronger or better. tuil un dorui baidal dur --xu. To fall into an extremely miserable state. zam dur --xu. To be on the right track; to get on the road, be on the road to. b) To yield, give in, obey; to fall under the influence of; to become addicted to; to be dependent on; to be in rut (of animals). --ysan temege. Camel in rut. aryan dur --xu. To fall into a trap (fig.). darulaydal un dour-a --xu. To come under the oppression of. erken dyr --xu. To come under the influence of. ORUCI yar tur --xu. To fall into somebody's hands; to come under somebody's influence. sysyg --xu. To embrace a faith, be converted. tegyn y keleky yge minu amin dur --mui. My life depends on what he will say. tere bolbasu minu amin dur --ysan jeke acitai kymyn møn. He is the man to whom I owe my life. ygen dyr --xu. To obey words, be influenced by words; to believe, trust. c) To hold, have the capacity of (of a container). ene longxu dur xojar zing --mui. This bottle holds two catties. idezy --xu ygei. To be unable to eat food; cannot eat any more. d) To enter upon, begin, start; to join; to be included, fall under; to be encompassed. aman dur --xu = kelen dyr --xu. To start to talk (of children). azil du --xu. To start work. bailduyan-a --xu. To become engaged in a battle. kele aman dur --xu. To be involved in an alter- cation. kereg tyr --xu. To be inyolved or entangled in a matter or lawsuit. kereg zaryu tu --xu. To be involved in a law- suit. medege --xu. To begin to understand, notice things; to regain consciousness. sanal --mui. An idea occurs. suryayuli dur --xu. To enter a school. yn-e --. To become valuable; to become more expensive. ynyr --. To begin to smell. e) To fall, come down. boruy-a --mui = xur-a --mui. It rains. casu --mui. It snows. doyusi --ysan zam. Downhill road. f) To require, take, take in. ene azil dur bay-a dayan yurban kymyn --mui. This work requires at least three persons. g)v. aux. When preceded by other verbs indi- cates direction into. dabkizu --xu. To gallop into. xaraizu --xu. To jump into.",
