    "explain": "v. caus. of xolbu-. XOLFU- n. Federation, association, alliance. adj. Joined, united, connected. 8 n. The act of xolbu-; connection, relation. OOOX v.i. To slip, slide; to turn back and forth. emegel --zu unaxu. To fall from a horse because the saddle slipped; tor the saddle to slip. v.1. To go away, avoid people; to elude, evade. adi. Evasive, shifty, elusive. adj. Turning from one side to another; not attached; sliding. O adj. and r. Tied, united, married; husband, spouse. See xolciry-a(n). adj. and n. Lavish, wasteful, flighty; squan- derer. [ = xolcaryan] n. Dissipation, extravagance; sumptuousness, luxury; magnificence, splendor. v.i. To dissipate one's fortune; to feast; to live well.",
