    "imageName": "LessingDict_Page_1160.jpg",
    "explain": "ARABAZANA hūm; T. a ra pa ca na hum; S. arapacana hüm. Sacred spell of the Bo. Manzusiri (insight), used together with OM MANI PADME HUM for Nidyber yzegci (compassion) and OM BAZRABA- NI HUM (power against demons) in invocations.",
