    "imageName": "LessingDict_Page_1161.jpg",
    "explain": "ARASIJAN, arasan, aršan, rasijan; T. bdud rtsi; S. rasājana. Elixir of immortality; holy water used in rituals; mineral waters used in therapeutics.",
