    "explain": "BELGE bilig, 1.; T. ye ces; S. jnāna. Knowledge, wisdom, gnosis, which is of five kinds: \"mirror- like\" (toli mety, T. me long lta bu, S. adarça - ); \"equality\" (tegsi, T. mnyam pa, S. samatā- ); \"analytic\" (øber-e øber-e \"dxayci, T. so sor rtog pa, S. pratyavekshaņa-); \" directed to duty\" (yiles i simdan bytygegci, T. bya ba grub pa, S. krtyā-nushthāņa- ); \" of the purity of the nom realm,nom un cinar un masi ariyun, T. chos kyi dbyings kyi rnam par dag pa;",
