    "explain": "BELGE bilig, 2. ; T. ces rab; S. prajnã. Insight, wisdom. -- cinar; T. mtshan nyid; S. lakshana. Essential or characteristic mark. busud un erke jin -- cinar; T. gzhang gi dbang gi mtshan nyid; S. para-tantra-lakshana. Mark(s) of relativity. ED 615 b under svabhāva. neiredkel yn -- ciņar; T. brtags pahi mtshan nyid; S. parikalpita-lakshana. Imaginary characteris- tics of the møn cinar (svabhāva). oyuyata bytygen -- cinar; T. yongs su grub pahi mtshan nyid; S. parinishpanna lakshana. Charac- teristics of absolute reality. iru-a; T. ltas ma; S. nimitta . Prognostic, omen, portent. (kiged) yliger; T. mtshan (dang) dpe. The 32 major and 80 minor physical characteristics of a \"great man\" jeke tørylkiten, esp. the Bu. -- ygei; T. mtshan ma med pa; S. animitta. Signless, unmarked; often = causeless (xoyusun).",
