    "imageName": "LessingDict_Page_1165.jpg",
    "explain": "BURXAN bolxu; T. htsang rgya bar hgyur ba. S.sambu- dhyate. To become perfectly enlightened, become a Bu.; to die. u yazar; T. sangs rgyas kyi sa; S. buddha-bhūmi. The stage of the Bu., title of a work. EB 4l0-ll. -- u køryg; T. sangs rgyas kyi sku hdra. Picture of a Buddha. --u mør; T. sangs rgyas kyi lam; S. Buddhamāgra. Path of the Bu. -- u nom; T. sangs rgyas kyi chos; S. Buddhadharma. The doctrine of the Bu . -- u orun. The rank of a Bu. Buddhahood; heaven. -- u sasin tan; T. sangs rgyas pa. S. Bauddha. Buddhist. tabun izayurtu --. A pentad of Bus. developed in later Bsm. each of whom is heading a \"mystic family\" (izayur). They are Vairocana, Aksho- bya, Ratnasambhava, Amitābha, Amoghasiddha.",
