    "explain": "Great Bos. tegen vacirtu; T. Lag na rdo rje, Phyag na ro rje, Phyag rdor; S. Vajrapāni. \"Thunderbolt hand\" (from the vacir which he carries in his hand); orig. ep. of Indra who in Bsm. in his placid form is one of the Eight Great Bos.,in his wrathful form he is one of the nom un sakiyulsun. Originally symbol of strength, he becomes later Lord of Mysteries. -- tur abxu; T. lag stabs, lag len. Practice, exercise. un abuca; T. phyag len, lag len. Practice, as opposed to theory; ritual act or agenda. ΓARCIΓ, GARCII; T. dkar chag. Summary, table of contents . See Pt.I.",
