    "imageName": "LessingDict_Page_1170.jpg",
    "explain": "GALAB, ΓALAB (fr. S.); T. bskal par bskal dus; S. kalpa. Time with reference to cosmic ages, eon. See Pt.I under yalab and ED 172. ebderekyi -- ; hjig (pahi) bskal (pa); S. samvarta- kalpa. Eon of destruction (of the world). ED540a. yal un --; T. mehi bskal pa, mes hjig pa; S. teja- samvartani. The period during which the universe will be destroyed by fire. jeke --; T. bskal par chen po, bskal chen; S. mahā - kalpa. The great period, the duration of the world from its beginning to its destruction. sain --; T. bskal bzang po; S. bhadra-kalpa. A good kalpa, a kalpa during which five Bus. appear successively. toytaxui --; T. hchags bskal pa; S. vivarta-kalpa. The period of regeneration. xoyusun --; T. stong pahi bskal pa; S. cünya-kalpa. An empty kalpa, an eon in which no Bu. appears.",
