    "imageName": "LessingDict_Page_1175.jpg",
    "explain": "MANDAL; T. dkyil hkhor; S. mandala. A disk (as the sun disk); (in Tantrism) mystic wheels ( as of the four elements) located in the four centers of the body. See also Pt.I and Yhk. 128-138. un zang yile; T. dkyil hkhor gyi cho ga, dkyil chog; S. madala-vidhi. Mandala ritual. yal -- ; T. sbyin sreg; S. homa. Fire or burnt offering. See Yhk. 150-16l. xota -- . A plastic (usually metallic) mandala. See Yhk. I,16l and picture.",
