    "imageName": "LessingDict_Page_1175.jpg",
    "explain": "MASI ; T. rab (tu), cin tu. Represents the S. intensifiers ati-, vi-. pra-and'the word parama. -- ariluysan; T. rnám par day pa; S. vicuddhi. Complete purity. delgerenggyi; T. cin tu rgyas pa; S. (maha-) vaipulyà. Same as delgerenggyl. gegegen; T. rab gsal. Collection of minor rituals recited in regular daily services.",
