    "imageName": "LessingDict_Page_1177.jpg",
    "explain": "NASUN u erketen; T. tshe la dbang ba; S. ayur-vaçitā. Mastery over one's life, i. e. freedom to stay in the sansar as long as desired; third mastery of a Bo. -- a tegylter, -- luya tegylter = amin xabijatu; T. tshe dang ldan pa; S. ayusmat. Long-living, a form of address with venerable disciples. ED 102. jegydkeky; T. tshe hpho ba; S. cyuti. Transfer of life; to die and be reborn. -- u yxayan; T. tshehi rig byed; S. ayurveda. The science of longevit. medicine.",
