    "tradRom": "niγuča",
    "imageName": "LessingDict_Page_1177.jpg",
    "explain": "MøRGYL un silyg; T. phyag tshal gyi tshigs bcad. Hymn of salutation or praise. MUNGXAΓ ;T. ma rig pa; S. avidyã. Non-wisdom, non-knowledge (not ignorance); it is the first link in the chain of correlations (sityn barilduly-a). The M. word is a semantic substitute. MUNI ( fr. S) T. thub pa; S. muni. Hermit, saint,sage. MUTUR ; T. phyag rgya; S. mudrā. See Pt. I under mutur and kylil. -- un abuly-a; T. phyag len. Procedure, agenda. N called sityn barilduly-a. Note that the second part of the binom sees to reflect the Chinese translation of the S., namely øngge \"color\" and Ch. se \"color\" represent here S. rūpa, T. gzugs, \"form\". NEREIDKEL ; T. tha snyad; S. vyavahāra. Conventional concept or term. ED 516 b. NIDYBER yzegci; T. pyan ras gzigs; S. Avalokiteçvara. \"Looking with his eyes\" - name of the most famous of all the Bos. He is popularly referred to as Arijabalo.The name is explained as meaning ziryuyan zyil amitan nuyud i nidyber yzegci; T. hgro drug sems can rnams la spyan ras gzigs, \"eyeing the six kinds of amitan\" (compassionately). yzegci erketen; T. Spyan ras gzig dbang phyug; S. Avalokitecvara. The complete name of Nidyber yzegci, nidyber translating Avalokita = spyan ras gzigs and erketen dbang phyugs S. ivara. NIDYN; T. mig; S. cakshus. Eye as the internal base of vision. See tøryn tygekyi. -- y erketen; T. mig gi dbang po; S, cakshus. The faculty of vision, \"organ\" of vision. -- y tein medekyi; T. mig gi rnam par çes pa; S. cakshur-vijnana. Visual consciousness, i. e. becoming conscious of seeing something . belge bilig yn -- tegysygsen; T. ye es kyi spyan dang ldan pa; S. jnāna-cakshus. Possessing the eye of wisdom. NIΓUCA ji bariyci; T. gsang ba hdzin pa; S. guhya- dhara. Holder of mysteries, ep. of the Bo. Vacirbani. jin blama; T. gsang bahi bla ma; S. guhya - guru. Guide in mysteries, mystagogue. jin ezen; T. Gsang bdag; S. Guhya-pati. Lord of Mysteries, ep. of Vacirbani.",
    "cyrillic": "а",
    "lessingForm": "NIIUCA",
